OL,3,APetrol prices rise by 5p over a week as
OL,4,AIran war sends oil higher
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average price of unleaded petrol
OL,7,Fhas risen by 5p a litre in the space of
OL,8,Fa week, according to the RAC, which
OL,9,Fwarned there was "no sign of any
OL,10,Frelief" for drivers.
OL,12,FThe motoring organisation said a litre
OL,13,Fof unleaded now costs 167.17p - the
OL,14,Fbiggest weekly increase since April -
OL,15,Fwhile diesel has also risen by 5p to
OL,16,F188.63p.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
