OL,3,APetrol prices rise by 5p over a week as
OL,4,AIran war sends oil higher
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuel prices have soared since the
OL,7,FUS-Israel war with Iran began at the
OL,8,Fend of February, with the fighting
OL,9,Fseverely disrupting supplies of crude
OL,10,Foil - a key ingredient in petrol and
OL,11,Fdiesel - across the Middle East.
OL,13,FThe price of Brent crude, the global
OL,14,Fbenchmark for oil, returned to $100 a
OL,15,Fbarrel for the first time since July,
OL,16,Fas hostilities escalated again.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
